WEBVTT

00:00.007 --> 00:01.674
THIS IS A WORK OF FICTION. UNDERAGE
DRINKING IS STRONGLY PROHIBITED.

00:01.675 --> 00:03.343
FORCEFUL ALCOHOL CONSUMPTION AND
SHAMEFUL ACTS ARE NOT ENCOURAGED.

00:03.344 --> 00:04.970
VIEW THIS AS A COMEDY. ALL CHARACTERS
APPEARING IN THIS WORK ARE OF LEGAL AGE.

00:06.889 --> 00:09.058
What are you talking
about, Big Brother?

00:09.517 --> 00:10.226
Huh ?

00:10.768 --> 00:11.726
Shiori?

00:11.727 --> 00:13.645
How could you just
get married like that?

00:13.646 --> 00:15.814
I won't ever let that happen.

00:17.149 --> 00:18.107
Big Sis Nanaka.

00:18.108 --> 00:18.734
Yes?

00:18.943 --> 00:19.901
Big Sis Chisa...

00:19.902 --> 00:23.112
isn't a person to leave books
scattered on the floor, right?

00:23.113 --> 00:24.515
True...

00:24.765 --> 00:27.058
They are still fully clothed.

00:27.059 --> 00:29.186
And they're sleeping
soundly which is weird,

00:29.187 --> 00:30.688
unbothered about
you coming home.

00:31.063 --> 00:34.358
Which means this must
have been a misunderstanding.

00:34.692 --> 00:36.068
Now that you mention it...

00:36.486 --> 00:37.319
Right?

00:37.320 --> 00:38.445
Uh... um.

00:38.446 --> 00:40.239
Exactly as you said, but...

00:40.490 --> 00:42.033
how do you figure all that out?

00:42.366 --> 00:44.619
It's as if you witnessed
the whole thing.

00:45.411 --> 00:47.079
It's just my observation.

00:54.253 --> 00:57.881
Let's ride out into the
highway of our youth

00:57.882 --> 01:00.885
Right now is always
the best of the season

01:01.093 --> 01:04.554
Get high on hope, as
we adults keep winning

01:04.555 --> 01:08.099
Let's take a dive to explore
an entirely new world

01:08.100 --> 01:11.394
GRAND BLUE DREAMING SEASON 2

01:11.395 --> 01:13.523
Ever Endless

01:14.732 --> 01:16.400
Ever Endless

01:18.152 --> 01:19.695
Ever Endless

01:21.572 --> 01:22.949
Ever Endless

01:23.616 --> 01:28.411
Mon-Tues-Weds-Thurs-Fri,
my life knows no variety

01:28.412 --> 01:29.831
Ever Endless

01:30.248 --> 01:35.043
Sat-Sun, wake up in the afternoon
with only my smartphone to surf

01:35.044 --> 01:36.628
Ever Endless

01:36.629 --> 01:38.046
All my limbs' been giving in

01:38.047 --> 01:39.881
Kalbi's a burden
like my lumber spine

01:39.882 --> 01:41.466
Doing family
service with irises dim

01:41.467 --> 01:43.094
But you know that
I'll go all the way

01:43.511 --> 01:46.681
Glitter, shimmer,
the light's shining

01:46.973 --> 01:50.517
Let's give it one more chance

01:50.518 --> 01:53.980
Let's ride out into the
highway of our youth

01:54.188 --> 01:56.983
Right now is always
the best of the season

01:57.191 --> 02:00.819
Get high on hope, as
we adults keep winning

02:00.820 --> 02:03.823
Let's take a dive to explore
an entirely new world

02:04.073 --> 02:06.199
Youth is when you never...

02:06.200 --> 02:07.701
stop chasing your own values

02:07.702 --> 02:09.369
Our youth's eternal

02:09.370 --> 02:10.954
the color never fades with age

02:10.955 --> 02:12.831
Youth is when you keep...

02:12.832 --> 02:14.374
getting lost along the way

02:14.375 --> 02:17.920
Youth is Forever

02:19.130 --> 02:20.255
Heh...

02:20.256 --> 02:21.966
So this is Iori's little sister.

02:22.216 --> 02:24.176
My name is Shiori Kitahara.

02:24.177 --> 02:26.428
Thank you for looking
after my brother.

02:26.429 --> 02:28.054
No, the pleasure is ours.

02:28.055 --> 02:29.264
Nice to meet you.

02:29.265 --> 02:30.807
So well-mannered.

02:30.808 --> 02:32.477
She's a good kid.

02:32.768 --> 02:34.937
So what did you come here for?

02:35.146 --> 02:36.939
To check up on you, of course.

02:37.482 --> 02:40.359
I already told you how
I was doing in the letter.

02:40.568 --> 02:42.068
Yes, that's right.

02:42.069 --> 02:45.656
You wrote that you were busy
studying and living a healthy life.

02:45.990 --> 02:48.951
I know that it was all lies
and came here to confirm.

02:49.368 --> 02:50.828
You already know me.

02:51.078 --> 02:53.289
I hate dishonesty the most.

02:53.790 --> 02:56.793
I understand you
like to jokes around,

02:57.168 --> 02:58.960
but just now you
were talking about

02:58.961 --> 03:00.630
quickly marrying Big Sis Chisa.

03:00.838 --> 03:02.547
What do you mean
"quickly marrying"?

03:02.548 --> 03:04.592
It's a long story.

03:04.926 --> 03:07.512
So you came here because
you're worried about Iori?

03:07.678 --> 03:08.678
Yes.

03:08.679 --> 03:11.515
And also to greet everyone.

03:11.516 --> 03:12.558
Oh my.

03:12.809 --> 03:14.267
So mature.

03:14.268 --> 03:16.061
Is she really
your little sister?

03:16.062 --> 03:17.146
How rude.

03:17.438 --> 03:19.440
Don't we look alike
when lining up like this?

03:20.483 --> 03:23.068
Yeah, look at the
same number of eyes.

03:23.069 --> 03:25.111
The tasteful amount of fingers.

03:25.112 --> 03:27.280
Is there nothing else to say?

03:27.281 --> 03:28.240
Oh, right.

03:28.241 --> 03:29.659
I also got something for you.

03:29.826 --> 03:30.700
Is it food?

03:30.701 --> 03:33.578
No, it's something
you left at home.

03:33.579 --> 03:33.745
IORI'S MUSIC NOTEBOOK
(FROM MIDDLE SCHOOL)

03:33.746 --> 03:35.498
TO MY FUTURE SELF It
must be very important, right?

03:35.623 --> 03:37.625
Stop!

03:37.875 --> 03:40.669
I'm so glad you're
jumping for joy.

03:40.670 --> 03:42.380
Where did you get this?

03:42.588 --> 03:46.467
Yes, I happened to find it when
I broke open a locked drawer.

03:46.926 --> 03:49.345
It was all
intentional, wasn't it!

03:49.929 --> 03:51.054
Did you look inside?

03:51.055 --> 03:54.308
I looked, but I'm not familiar
with musical notes so...

03:55.226 --> 03:56.268
I had the whole
family decipher it.

03:56.269 --> 03:57.185
Huh ?

03:57.186 --> 04:00.147
I also have a recording
of dad singing it.

04:00.148 --> 04:02.859
What in the world have you done!

04:03.693 --> 04:05.069
SMASH

04:05.778 --> 04:08.447
By the way, how
are uncle and aunt?

04:08.656 --> 04:10.699
Mom and dad are doing well.

04:10.700 --> 04:13.286
They said it would be nice
if you came by next time.

04:13.411 --> 04:15.413
If you'd like, you
may all come as well.

04:15.621 --> 04:17.706
KITAHARA INN My
family runs an inn.

04:17.707 --> 04:19.082
Wow, amazing!

04:19.083 --> 04:20.793
I'd love to visit sometime.

04:21.335 --> 04:22.669
Does that mean...

04:22.670 --> 04:24.881
Iori will take over
the inn in the future?

04:25.047 --> 04:28.217
No. My dad has no intention
of letting an idiot take over.

04:28.509 --> 04:29.926
I guess that's that then.

04:29.927 --> 04:31.470
Truly a wise decision.

04:31.471 --> 04:33.723
I don't plan on
taking over either.

04:33.890 --> 04:34.848
Ah, is that so?

04:34.849 --> 04:37.058
Business isn't
suited for idiots.

04:37.059 --> 04:39.228
So you do know your place.

04:39.562 --> 04:43.106
Can you stop talking
as if I really am an idiot?

04:43.107 --> 04:45.108
I just don't want to take over.

04:45.109 --> 04:47.403
Don't say that, Big Brother.

04:48.112 --> 04:50.280
If you work hard,
you wouldn't be stupid.

04:50.281 --> 04:52.867
I'm telling you that your
assumption is wrong!

04:53.159 --> 04:55.119
Anyway, you're done here, right?

04:55.328 --> 04:56.828
I'm taking you to the station.

04:56.829 --> 04:57.997
You're not staying?

04:58.706 --> 05:00.499
You came all this way.

05:00.500 --> 05:02.209
She has entrance
exams this year.

05:02.210 --> 05:04.294
Even then, it's only for a bit.

05:04.295 --> 05:05.630
Are your exams hard?

05:05.880 --> 05:07.547
I have a little leeway though.

05:07.548 --> 05:08.841
That is too naive.

05:09.258 --> 05:11.385
You need to study everyday.

05:11.719 --> 05:13.762
Such a rudimentary
selection of vocabulary.

05:13.763 --> 05:16.516
The blandishing rhetoric is
preternaturally inadequate.

05:16.682 --> 05:19.017
Alright, you're going
home. Right now.

05:19.018 --> 05:19.851
Big Brother!

05:19.852 --> 05:20.520
Hmm?

05:20.978 --> 05:23.773
Is my presence
here a bother to you?

05:24.565 --> 05:25.691
Shiori...

05:26.317 --> 05:27.567
It is annoying as hell.

05:27.568 --> 05:28.735
He actually said it!

05:28.736 --> 05:30.780
Not a milk's ounce
of brotherly kindness!

05:31.739 --> 05:32.949
Is that so?

05:33.157 --> 05:34.407
Hey Iori!

05:34.408 --> 05:35.827
How could you say that!

05:36.410 --> 05:38.328
Is no one on my side?

05:38.329 --> 05:41.456
Ah, it must be
tough for Iori, too.

05:41.457 --> 05:43.251
Do you understand, Azusa-san?

05:43.459 --> 05:44.669
I do, I do.

05:44.919 --> 05:45.127
"Little sister" times "cute"

05:45.128 --> 05:46.545
LITTLE SISTER X CUTE X
MIDDLE SCHOOL GIRL + KOUHEI = ?

05:46.546 --> 05:49.381
times "middle school
girl" plus Kouhei equals...

05:49.382 --> 05:50.633
The death of Iori, eh?

05:51.551 --> 05:53.761
Hurry up, Shiori!
Before that guy comes...

05:55.263 --> 05:57.557
Hello there, Kitahara.

05:59.475 --> 06:01.685
Is that girl your sister?

06:01.686 --> 06:02.811
You are wrong.

06:02.812 --> 06:04.604
I'm Shiori, his little sister.

06:04.605 --> 06:06.399
Are you trying to finish me off?

06:07.733 --> 06:08.609
I see.

06:10.611 --> 06:11.779
Kouhei...

06:12.071 --> 06:14.323
If I feed his head
to some stray dogs...

06:14.448 --> 06:15.866
Stop it, Kouhei, calm down.

06:15.867 --> 06:19.287
Silence! You hellspawn who plunged
the physical world into perpetual misery.

06:19.495 --> 06:21.538
But I am not a devil.

06:21.539 --> 06:22.289
What?

06:22.290 --> 06:24.459
If you accept my
condition, I'll spare you.

06:26.002 --> 06:26.752
That...

06:26.961 --> 06:28.129
You know...

06:29.088 --> 06:32.425
If she calls me "Kouhei-bro"...

06:32.592 --> 06:34.634
You are truly a
disgusting person.

06:34.635 --> 06:36.219
Then die!

06:36.220 --> 06:38.181
Wait, who said I refused?

06:38.806 --> 06:41.099
Shiori, do as he says.

06:41.100 --> 06:41.975
Huh?

06:41.976 --> 06:42.809
Please.

06:42.810 --> 06:45.396
My life is hanging on
a single word from you.

06:45.563 --> 06:47.106
Uh... Uhm...

06:47.857 --> 06:50.818
That's... too embarrassing.

06:51.027 --> 06:52.819
That's a shame, Kitahara!

06:52.820 --> 06:55.239
Are you leaving your
brother to die, Shiori?

06:55.740 --> 06:57.200
So, how about...

06:57.658 --> 06:59.202
Big Brother Kouhei?

07:03.039 --> 07:03.705
Huh...

07:03.706 --> 07:04.832
Kitahara!

07:05.666 --> 07:06.709
What is it?

07:07.001 --> 07:08.336
Take this.

07:08.503 --> 07:09.879
Wait! What's this money for?

07:10.463 --> 07:13.381
I was planning to spend
it on Lalako-tan's goods.

07:13.382 --> 07:15.051
I didn't ask where it came from.

07:15.259 --> 07:16.427
Lalako-tan?

07:16.636 --> 07:18.471
It's the anime
that Kouhei likes.

07:18.930 --> 07:22.015
Ah, you mean "Magical
Girl Lalako," right?

07:22.016 --> 07:22.766
Huh?

07:22.767 --> 07:23.558
You know it?

07:23.559 --> 07:25.019
Yes, but only a little bit.

07:25.603 --> 07:28.648
I also like "Magical
Girl Lalako."

07:32.318 --> 07:33.610
Kitahara...

07:33.611 --> 07:34.278
What is it?

07:34.529 --> 07:36.071
For real, take it...

07:36.072 --> 07:37.740
I told you, what's
this money for?

07:37.990 --> 07:39.366
As you can see, Shiori.

07:39.367 --> 07:41.119
It is dangerous for you to stay.

07:41.536 --> 07:42.787
Is that so?

07:43.830 --> 07:46.790
Then I won't leave your
side, not even for a moment.

07:46.791 --> 07:48.626
That's what's dangerous.

07:48.793 --> 07:50.085
In any case, just go home.

07:50.086 --> 07:50.752
No.

07:50.753 --> 07:51.586
Go home!

07:51.587 --> 07:51.920
No!

07:51.921 --> 07:52.587
Go home!

07:52.588 --> 07:53.463
- No!
- Hey, hey.

07:53.464 --> 07:54.506
- Go home!
- Don't fight.

07:54.507 --> 07:56.926
I told you, at times like
these, let's decide by a game.

07:57.802 --> 07:58.885
Got it.

07:58.886 --> 08:00.428
SHIORI'S SIDE

08:00.429 --> 08:01.889
IORI'S SIDE

08:02.431 --> 08:04.349
Alright, let's settle
with a team battle.

08:04.350 --> 08:05.809
We'll be the referees.

08:05.810 --> 08:07.728
Such a huge number
difference here.

08:08.187 --> 08:09.312
Help me out.

08:09.313 --> 08:10.147
I refuse.

08:10.148 --> 08:12.316
Is that so? Then...

08:12.608 --> 08:15.027
I'll badmouth you to Shiori.

08:15.570 --> 08:16.946
You scum.

08:17.280 --> 08:18.030
Huh?

08:27.832 --> 08:30.501
With this, I won't
have to choose either...

08:31.711 --> 08:33.628
To think he'd
choose to off himself.

08:33.629 --> 08:35.422
Truly a noble
warrior's way to die.

08:35.423 --> 08:36.132
But...

08:36.591 --> 08:38.967
Iori is badmouthing anyway.

08:38.968 --> 08:41.386
Bugs are his staple food.

08:41.387 --> 08:42.220
What?!

08:42.221 --> 08:43.431
Is he a demon?

08:43.931 --> 08:44.055
PAPER SUMO - ROCK-PAPER-SCISSORS

08:44.056 --> 08:45.933
DROP THE HANDKERCHIEF
Alright, the game will be...

08:46.309 --> 08:47.809
Drop the handkerchief huh?

08:47.810 --> 08:49.978
Such a nostalgic game.

08:49.979 --> 08:51.062
Whose idea was this?

08:51.063 --> 08:51.939
Mine.

08:52.231 --> 08:53.398
Let's make some space.

08:53.399 --> 08:55.609
- Let me get the chairs.
- To think that's what you wanted to play,

08:55.610 --> 08:57.778
Shiori is still such a kid.

09:02.742 --> 09:03.493
- Huh?
- Huh?

09:08.748 --> 09:09.956
Big Brother.

09:09.957 --> 09:11.375
This is my way of playing...

09:11.918 --> 09:13.836
Drop the Handkerchief.

09:14.170 --> 09:15.838
Huh, Iori?

09:16.255 --> 09:18.341
He said he suddenly
feels sleepy.

09:18.633 --> 09:22.512
Maybe he felt so relaxed after seeing
his sister that his body went limp?

09:22.678 --> 09:24.095
Here we go.

09:24.096 --> 09:25.514
- One, two! One, two!
- I'll show you to your room.

09:25.515 --> 09:26.348
- One, two! One, two!
- Thanks.

09:26.349 --> 09:27.558
Ah, I'll help.

09:29.477 --> 09:30.936
But you know...

09:30.937 --> 09:31.686
What?

09:31.687 --> 09:34.606
Wouldn't Shiori-chan's
tastes match up with yours?

09:34.607 --> 09:35.398
You think?

09:35.399 --> 09:38.361
Because you really
like Chii-chan, right?

09:38.569 --> 09:39.403
Yeah.

09:39.612 --> 09:42.657
At first glance, she seems
to really like her brother...

09:43.032 --> 09:45.743
but I feel like
something's not right.

09:50.581 --> 09:54.252
I will never forgive you for
running away from home.

09:55.503 --> 09:56.837
You terrible brother.

09:56.838 --> 09:57.922
GRAND BLUE DREAMING SEASON 2

09:59.549 --> 10:01.341
My name is Shiori Kitahara.

10:01.342 --> 10:02.926
I'm a third-year
student in middle school,

10:02.927 --> 10:04.470
I'm an Aries and
my blood type is AB.

10:04.679 --> 10:06.931
My family runs an old
inn that I do not work in.

10:08.015 --> 10:10.309
I'd like to make a confession.

10:11.018 --> 10:12.979
The truth is, I...

10:13.479 --> 10:15.940
don't particularly
like my brother at all.

10:19.277 --> 10:20.236
So bright.

10:20.778 --> 10:23.738
Big Brother, it's
morning. Wake up.

10:23.739 --> 10:27.952
So why am I acting
like a doting wife?

10:28.202 --> 10:28.452
KITAHARA INN

10:28.453 --> 10:31.372
It's all to make my
brother take over the inn.

10:31.873 --> 10:33.082
For that purpose,

10:33.499 --> 10:35.710
I'll have to act out
the role of a bro-con.

10:36.419 --> 10:37.712
Good morning.

10:37.879 --> 10:39.087
Oh, morning.

10:39.088 --> 10:40.672
You're up awfully early today.

10:40.673 --> 10:42.758
Shiori woke me up.

10:43.009 --> 10:45.135
What are you
saying, Big Brother?

10:45.136 --> 10:48.138
Work at the inn
starts even earlier.

10:48.139 --> 10:51.266
It's not like I'm gonna
work there anyway.

10:51.267 --> 10:52.559
Huh?

10:52.560 --> 10:55.062
You think you can get
any other decent job?

10:55.521 --> 10:59.108
I believe that you will
come home eventually.

10:59.358 --> 11:02.862
How admirable of you, Iori-kun.
You are properly dressed up!

11:03.029 --> 11:07.074
Humans really need to wear
clothes at least every other day.

11:07.658 --> 11:10.118
Give me a second,
breakfast will be ready soon.

11:10.119 --> 11:13.289
Big Sis Nanaka, may I help?

11:13.539 --> 11:15.500
If so, then let's
make it together.

11:18.711 --> 11:21.214
Now, begin the operation.

11:21.631 --> 11:23.132
Thanks for the food.

11:23.341 --> 11:25.760
Shiori-chan made most of it.

11:26.093 --> 11:28.136
I hope you all like it.

11:28.137 --> 11:29.846
Oh, delicious.

11:29.847 --> 11:32.058
Shiori-chan, your
cooking is great.

11:32.266 --> 11:33.643
Not at all.

11:33.893 --> 11:38.522
The miso is from home, the sweet omelette
that should be familiar to his tastes.

11:38.523 --> 11:41.150
The pickles are
also my specialty.

11:41.609 --> 11:45.029
Now, Big Brother,
welcome homesickness.

11:45.530 --> 11:48.658
Food this good makes
you miss home, eh?

11:48.908 --> 11:51.536
Like "mom's cooking," you mean?

11:52.078 --> 11:53.663
What did it taste like again?

11:53.830 --> 11:54.871
Come on.

11:54.872 --> 11:56.498
Your memory is awful.

11:56.499 --> 11:58.334
What am I going
to do with this idiot?

11:58.960 --> 12:01.294
Then this time, I'll act
even more like a bro-con

12:01.295 --> 12:03.631
and make them disgusted with us.

12:06.551 --> 12:07.551
Oops.

12:07.552 --> 12:09.303
Are you okay, Big Brother?

12:10.471 --> 12:12.390
You should change quickly.

12:12.849 --> 12:14.182
Want to take a bath?

12:14.183 --> 12:16.309
Come to think of it, I
didn't bathe yesterday.

12:16.310 --> 12:18.479
Well then, Big
Brother, let's do that.

12:18.771 --> 12:21.481
I will join you and
scrub your back.

12:21.482 --> 12:22.691
Oh, how nice.

12:22.692 --> 12:23.401
Huh ?

12:26.529 --> 12:28.155
How nice?

12:28.156 --> 12:30.450
You agree with that? This
should weird people out.

12:30.741 --> 12:33.119
Surely, there has to be
one person who's creeped...

12:34.203 --> 12:36.497
I don't care about
your feelings!

12:36.873 --> 12:40.292
Maybe I'll join
Chisa-chan in the bath too.

12:40.293 --> 12:42.420
- It will be too cramped, so no.
- Huh!

12:42.587 --> 12:45.338
I want those two to be
the most creeped out.

12:45.339 --> 12:47.883
Shiori, let me tell
you something.

12:47.884 --> 12:49.010
Y-Yes?

12:49.218 --> 12:51.721
- Eh? It's fine, isn't it.
- Don't provoke Nanaka-san unnecessarily.

12:51.888 --> 12:53.306
I don't understand
what you mean.

12:53.598 --> 12:56.517
Well then, I'll go
get the bath ready.

12:56.976 --> 12:58.561
Are you really coming?

12:58.978 --> 13:01.522
Yes, if you allow it...

13:01.981 --> 13:02.898
Unforgivable!

13:02.899 --> 13:04.859
Argh! Where did you come from?!

13:05.067 --> 13:06.318
That was close.

13:06.319 --> 13:07.653
It's okay now.

13:07.778 --> 13:09.321
Huh? Ah, yes.

13:09.322 --> 13:12.115
You should look
after yourself better.

13:12.116 --> 13:14.368
Um, if I'm not mistaken,
you're Imamura-senpai?

13:15.411 --> 13:17.078
No, Shiori-chan.

13:17.079 --> 13:19.582
Sorry, did I get
your name wrong?

13:19.749 --> 13:22.125
No, it's just the
way you said it.

13:22.126 --> 13:25.379
Come on, you know the
proper way to address me.

13:25.630 --> 13:26.756
Uhm...

13:27.423 --> 13:29.592
Bug-eating Imamura-senpai!

13:29.759 --> 13:32.136
What did you tell her?!

13:32.678 --> 13:35.056
Well, shall we start preparing?

13:35.848 --> 13:37.600
Is there something
going on today?

13:38.059 --> 13:38.851
Yup.

13:39.519 --> 13:40.811
It's the continuation
of Iori's license course.

13:40.812 --> 13:43.022
AIR TANK

13:45.358 --> 13:46.234
What?

13:46.442 --> 13:49.319
Are you really
going into the sea?

13:49.320 --> 13:51.197
This is a diving
club, after all.

13:51.489 --> 13:54.491
I thought this was just a
cover for a drinking group.

13:54.492 --> 13:56.160
That's not...

13:57.161 --> 13:57.828
Iori.

13:57.829 --> 14:00.039
You need to speak
up when you respond.

14:00.289 --> 14:02.542
By the way, can you
swim, Shiori-chan?

14:02.959 --> 14:04.668
Nothing fancy, but yes.

14:04.669 --> 14:06.378
Iori can't swim, though.

14:06.379 --> 14:07.088
Drop it.

14:07.338 --> 14:10.299
Maybe you're not
siblings after all?

14:10.508 --> 14:11.716
What are you saying?

14:11.717 --> 14:14.178
My dear Big Brother
is my dear Big Brother.

14:14.428 --> 14:17.931
Hmm, then answer these
questions about Shiori-chan.

14:17.932 --> 14:20.601
These are just things that
you want to know, right?

14:20.768 --> 14:23.728
Question one: What's
her favorite food?

14:23.729 --> 14:25.231
Probably Japanese sweets.

14:25.898 --> 14:28.275
Question two: What
does she dislike?

14:28.276 --> 14:29.694
Technology in general.

14:31.070 --> 14:33.446
Question three: What kind
of clothes does she like?

14:33.447 --> 14:34.574
Kimonos, right?

14:34.782 --> 14:35.700
Is he right?

14:36.159 --> 14:38.201
Fufu, as expected
of my Big Brother.

14:38.202 --> 14:40.537
Not a single one was correct.

14:40.538 --> 14:44.082
My favorite food is donuts,
and I'm good with machines.

14:44.083 --> 14:46.878
I only wear a kimono
to appease my parents.

14:47.170 --> 14:49.629
I'm impressed by
how well you know me.

14:49.630 --> 14:51.090
Well, that's good to hear.

14:51.424 --> 14:52.799
By the way, Shiori-chan,

14:52.800 --> 14:54.719
if you have no plans,
why not join us?

14:54.969 --> 14:57.180
By joining you, do
you mean diving?

14:57.430 --> 14:58.555
Since you're here now.

14:58.556 --> 15:00.850
It's super fun and feels great.

15:01.434 --> 15:03.226
If I approve the diving,

15:03.227 --> 15:06.021
my brother will get a chance to
create a new place for himself.

15:06.022 --> 15:07.106
Uhm...

15:07.273 --> 15:09.816
I'm sorry, I'll have to decline.

15:09.817 --> 15:11.777
I didn't prepare
a swimsuit either.

15:12.320 --> 15:14.279
If you don't mind my spare.

15:14.280 --> 15:15.239
Or mine.

15:15.531 --> 15:17.783
I appreciate the thought, but...

15:17.784 --> 15:19.494
Ah, I see.

15:20.369 --> 15:22.121
The size won't fit, right?

15:24.540 --> 15:26.959
What the fuck
is this jerk doing?

15:27.168 --> 15:28.251
Hey Iori.

15:28.252 --> 15:29.377
What are you doing?

15:29.378 --> 15:30.545
Huh? Is it not okay?

15:30.546 --> 15:31.630
No, wait.

15:31.631 --> 15:34.592
I'll have to up my
role as a bro-con.

15:35.092 --> 15:37.220
Honestly, Big Brother...

15:37.804 --> 15:39.095
I'm going to kill you.

15:39.096 --> 15:40.556
Oops, I said it out loud.

15:41.057 --> 15:45.728
But Big Brother is right,
your swimsuits are a little...

15:46.020 --> 15:47.229
Is that so?

15:47.230 --> 15:50.066
Nanaka's is way too big
no matter how you look at it.

15:52.026 --> 15:55.863
Mine... might... fit you...

15:57.532 --> 16:00.325
It's okay. You still
have time to grow.

16:00.326 --> 16:02.203
Please stop consoling me.

16:02.453 --> 16:05.705
I will watch your gallant
figure from the shore.

16:05.706 --> 16:06.791
Is that so?

16:06.999 --> 16:09.126
Well, if you say
so, I won't force it.

16:09.127 --> 16:10.086
Wait a sec!

16:10.419 --> 16:11.879
A present.

16:13.548 --> 16:14.298
Huh?

16:14.674 --> 16:16.968
DEAR LITTLE SISTER LITTLE SISTER

16:17.093 --> 16:20.095
Ah! A wild policeman appeared.

16:20.096 --> 16:21.722
Hold off on the
report, Kitahara.

16:23.808 --> 16:26.476
Rest assured,
you're just mistaken.

16:26.477 --> 16:27.102
BRAND NEW

16:27.103 --> 16:28.478
It's brand new.

16:28.479 --> 16:31.357
If it was used, I'd be
trembling with fear.

16:31.816 --> 16:33.817
Please don't worry
about me, everyone.

16:33.818 --> 16:37.363
I'm completely content with
just watching Big Brother.

16:47.206 --> 16:49.250
Do you not like the
sea, Shiori-chan?

16:49.459 --> 16:50.042
Huh?

16:51.878 --> 16:54.045
I don't go in much,

16:54.046 --> 16:56.424
but I think it's a charming
and wonderful place.

16:58.009 --> 17:00.635
A smart and considerate answer.

17:00.636 --> 17:02.221
No, not at all.

17:02.472 --> 17:06.184
That's exactly why I want a
girl like you to try diving once.

17:06.642 --> 17:08.102
What do you mean?

17:08.311 --> 17:10.688
It's a precious
thing for smart kids.

17:10.980 --> 17:14.400
A chance where you can just
empty your mind within nature.

17:14.942 --> 17:18.279
Well, if you think they are
having fun, you should give it a try.

17:19.447 --> 17:20.781
Diving...

17:21.324 --> 17:24.243
For me, bringing my brother
back is more important.

17:24.619 --> 17:28.539
Besides, having
fun... somehow...

17:39.759 --> 17:42.470
I want to try too.

17:43.221 --> 17:45.306
Then will you dive with me?

17:45.473 --> 17:48.309
Ah no, I want to
go with Big Brother.

17:48.601 --> 17:50.770
I'm in the middle of an exam.

17:51.062 --> 17:53.731
I'll try to stay as close
to Iori as possible.

17:54.607 --> 17:55.817
I understand.

17:56.108 --> 17:59.904
It's absolutely not because I saw everyone
having fun including my Big Brother.

18:00.321 --> 18:01.696
It's not like that.

18:01.697 --> 18:04.491
I'll adjust the buoyancy,
so don't worry.

18:04.492 --> 18:05.159
Yes.

18:13.334 --> 18:14.502
Heh...

18:14.669 --> 18:17.171
Is this the scenery
inside the sea?

18:17.797 --> 18:19.881
Maybe because it
rained the other day,

18:19.882 --> 18:22.218
the water isn't very clear.

18:29.308 --> 18:30.226
But...

18:30.560 --> 18:33.646
being with people without
hearing their voices,

18:35.022 --> 18:37.400
I don't have to watch my words.

18:38.109 --> 18:42.280
This wondrous time
might indeed be precious.

18:44.907 --> 18:49.077
Well then, to welcome Shiori-chan
and to celebrate Iori getting his license,

18:49.078 --> 18:51.080
cheers!

18:51.622 --> 18:54.500
Now you're a proper
Open Water Diver.

18:55.209 --> 18:57.919
If I didn't have a cold, it would
have been a piece of cake.

18:57.920 --> 19:00.339
But you still failed at
buoyancy neutralization.

19:00.798 --> 19:02.507
How was it, Shiori-chan?

19:02.508 --> 19:03.550
Uhm...

19:03.551 --> 19:05.887
It was like swimming
in miso soup.

19:06.929 --> 19:08.221
There was seaweed too.

19:08.222 --> 19:10.098
That's what it's
like after it rains.

19:10.099 --> 19:11.851
It's usually much prettier.

19:12.268 --> 19:15.061
But I had a very new experience.

19:15.062 --> 19:16.772
Good for you.

19:20.359 --> 19:22.486
That oolong tea is "flammable."

19:22.487 --> 19:24.864
His pants are almost fell off.

19:25.490 --> 19:27.741
As expected, I should
get back to the main task.

19:27.742 --> 19:32.079
Later, I'll find his report
card and report to our parents.

19:38.127 --> 19:40.129
Honestly, Big Brother.

19:42.924 --> 19:44.049
What are you doing?

19:44.050 --> 19:44.634
Huh?

19:45.718 --> 19:49.137
I came to change and saw it was
so messy, so I decided to tidy it up.

19:49.138 --> 19:52.391
Yeah, so the closet
finally collapsed.

19:52.600 --> 19:54.518
What did you come here for?

19:54.519 --> 19:56.521
I was looking for you.

19:56.687 --> 19:58.021
I was thinking of something.

19:58.022 --> 20:00.024
Don't tell me he found out?

20:01.567 --> 20:02.944
You actually...

20:03.778 --> 20:06.446
wanted to head out
somewhere else today, right?

20:06.447 --> 20:07.281
What?

20:07.740 --> 20:09.658
No, that's not it.

20:09.659 --> 20:11.077
Then it's fine.

20:11.202 --> 20:14.080
This denseness, as
expected of Big Brother.

20:14.372 --> 20:16.833
You're worrying too
much, Big Brother.

20:17.041 --> 20:17.082
LEAVE IT TO SIS, BEND OVER

20:17.083 --> 20:17.499
MIO NISHINO

20:17.500 --> 20:18.291
SECRETARY'S DEEP
SECRET You think so?

20:18.292 --> 20:19.043
AYANO HOSHINO

20:19.961 --> 20:22.338
I'm not a child anymore.

20:22.839 --> 20:25.633
But you're bad at
speaking your mind.

20:25.842 --> 20:27.468
That's not true.

20:27.593 --> 20:31.347
But you're not good at saying
you hate taking over the inn either.

20:31.514 --> 20:32.140
Huh?

20:33.224 --> 20:34.016
What's wrong?

20:34.392 --> 20:37.728
Just now, about me
hating to take over the inn...

20:38.229 --> 20:39.272
Listen.

20:39.647 --> 20:42.650
I don't know how much
of an idiot you think I am,

20:42.859 --> 20:44.569
but I know that much.

20:45.528 --> 20:48.573
Even though I don't know
your favorite food or clothes,

20:49.532 --> 20:51.451
I'm still your Big Brother.

21:02.462 --> 21:05.131
How did you know where I was?

21:05.381 --> 21:06.883
That's simple.

21:07.758 --> 21:09.844
Because I'm your Big Brother.

21:12.263 --> 21:13.514
Big Brother...

21:14.682 --> 21:17.142
Then please take over
the family business.

21:17.143 --> 21:18.602
Sorry, no can do.

21:18.603 --> 21:19.228
Eh!?

21:21.981 --> 21:22.899
Pout.

21:23.733 --> 21:26.027
Well then, Shiori, say
goodbye to everyone.

21:26.444 --> 21:27.527
See you again.

21:27.528 --> 21:29.989
It'd be nice if you come
when the water is clearer.

21:31.699 --> 21:32.492
What's wrong?

21:32.784 --> 21:36.287
I will go home quietly, so
Big Brother, come with me.

21:36.662 --> 21:39.624
You're planning to just lock
me up at home, aren't you?

21:40.500 --> 21:43.669
I'll visit home sooner or later,
so you go back first today.

21:45.713 --> 21:48.799
She really does
look like Nanaka.

21:48.800 --> 21:49.508
Huh?

21:49.509 --> 21:50.426
What do you mean?

21:50.718 --> 21:53.637
Coming alone to see a brother
who ran away from home,

21:53.638 --> 21:56.891
imitating what he does, and
worrying about his living environment.

21:57.433 --> 22:00.728
That's a bro-con through
and through, right?

22:03.689 --> 22:05.483
My name is Shiori Kitahara.

22:06.484 --> 22:08.986
I don't particularly
like my brother.

22:09.529 --> 22:10.279
But...

22:11.531 --> 22:13.741
I guess I don't hate
him entirely after all.

22:21.541 --> 22:23.083
Wanna talk to you,
wanna talk to you

22:23.084 --> 22:24.960
First I gotta know all
about you, isn't that right?

22:24.961 --> 22:26.920
Ending it off at round
one reeks of boredom

22:26.921 --> 22:28.672
Rounds two, three,
and four is the plan

22:28.673 --> 22:30.382
As the night gets deeper,
true thoughts escape

22:30.383 --> 22:32.300
Let us go on and on
and dive down late

22:32.301 --> 22:35.303
Your history, your scenery, for
me will your pages get slippery

22:35.304 --> 22:37.347
Hey, show me even more

22:37.348 --> 22:39.099
This is my track and
you are the featured guest

22:39.100 --> 22:40.684
We'll forget by the
time when the dawn hits

22:40.685 --> 22:42.144
Being incomplete is perfection

22:42.145 --> 22:44.396
Hey, show me even more

22:44.397 --> 22:45.981
My mouth keeps slipping,
my mouth keeps slipping

22:45.982 --> 22:47.607
Complaint whether
we sober upward

22:47.608 --> 22:49.652
For now, let's ride
high on this feeling

22:50.027 --> 22:56.075
Let's live this moment with all we
can without leaving a single regret

22:56.576 --> 22:58.285
We are gonna do it,
we go past the limit now

22:58.286 --> 22:59.911
Not just the whole night,
party till the sun is out

22:59.912 --> 23:02.080
Let's fly high

23:02.081 --> 23:02.664
(Let's fly high)

23:02.665 --> 23:04.666
So first, you just strip it down

23:04.667 --> 23:06.960
An exposed and
feral kind of bond

23:06.961 --> 23:10.589
It's the way of life's cycle,
let us go way beyond

23:10.590 --> 23:12.215
The very moment that
we met I drop my shy act

23:12.216 --> 23:13.967
I wanna bare it all and
say what I need to say

23:13.968 --> 23:15.970
Do it now...

23:16.762 --> 23:21.057
This is the magic spell that breaks
down each and every single wall

23:21.058 --> 23:24.519
And once you get used to
it, you won't feel a thing at all

23:24.520 --> 23:26.021
Being without clothes
is a mystery I live in

23:26.022 --> 23:27.772
The drinking and chatting
is flowing more freely

23:27.773 --> 23:30.151
Try it now...

23:30.568 --> 23:34.070
And right before you
realize what's going on

23:34.071 --> 23:38.284
Your heart will catch
right up and finally be free

23:44.874 --> 23:49.879
NEXT TIME: IMPRESSION GAME
